#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Setup instructions for using IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK "
"and Qiskit Runtime jobs by using the REST API"
msgstr ""
"Arahan persediaan untuk menggunakan IBM Quantum di IBM Cloud bagi menghantar"
" kerja Qiskit SDK dan Qiskit Runtime menggunakan REST API"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API"
msgstr "Sediakan untuk menggunakan IBM Quantum Platform dengan REST API"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API {#set-up-to-use-ibm-"
"quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan untuk menggunakan IBM Quantum Platform dengan REST API {#set-up-to-"
"use-ibm-quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can access quantum processors with REST APIs, enabling you to work with "
"QPUs using any programming language or framework.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh mengakses pemproses kuantum dengan REST API, membolehkan anda "
"bekerja dengan QPU menggunakan mana-mana bahasa pengaturcaraan atau rangka "
"kerja.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get access {#1-get-access}"
msgstr "1. Dapatkan akses {#1-get-access}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not already have a user account, get one at the [IBM Quantum login"
" page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda belum mempunyai akaun pengguna, dapatkan satu di [halaman log "
"masuk IBM Quantum.](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an API key (also called a token) on the "
"[dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Note that the same API key can "
"be used for either region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cipta kunci API (juga dipanggil token) di [papan "
"pemuka.](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) Perlu diambil perhatian bahawa kunci"
" API yang sama boleh digunakan untuk mana-mana rantau.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Generate an IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) bearer token. This is a short-lived token  used to authenticate requests to the REST API. To generate one, call the [IAM Identity Services API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) as shown in the following sample request:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Jana token pembawa (bearer token) IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM). Ini ialah token jangka pendek yang digunakan untuk mengesahkan permintaan ke REST API. Untuk menjana satu, panggil [API Perkhidmatan Identiti IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam permintaan contoh berikut:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   Expected Response\n"
msgstr "   Respons yang Dijangka\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   </TabItem>\n"
msgstr "   </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Choose an authentication method {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"
msgstr "2. Pilih kaedah pengesahan {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose the appropriate authentication method, depending on your working "
"environment:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilih kaedah pengesahan yang sesuai, bergantung pada persekitaran kerja "
"anda:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an environment variable for your API key (trusted Python "
"environments)](#environment_variable)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Cipta pemboleh ubah persekitaran untuk kunci API anda (persekitaran Python "
"yang dipercayai)](#environment_variable)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use your API key directly (untrusted environment)](/guides/cloud-setup-"
"untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Guna kunci API anda secara langsung (persekitaran yang tidak "
"dipercayai)](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an environment variable (trusted environment) {#create-an-"
"environment-variable-trusted-environment}"
msgstr ""
"Cipta pemboleh ubah persekitaran (persekitaran yang dipercayai) {#create-an-"
"environment-variable-trusted-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To set the IQP_API_TOKEN environment variable in your system, you can add "
"the following line to your shell profile (for example, .bashrc or .zshrc) or"
" by setting it directly in your terminal:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menetapkan pemboleh ubah persekitaran IQP_API_TOKEN dalam sistem anda,"
" anda boleh menambah baris berikut ke profil shell anda (contohnya, .bashrc "
"atau .zshrc) atau dengan menetapkannya terus dalam terminal anda:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    When you invoke the environment variable in your code, include `import os`, as in this example:\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Apabila anda memanggil pemboleh ubah persekitaran dalam kod anda, sertakan `import os`, seperti dalam contoh ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Note that when creating an environment variable, your API key is still stored locally in plain text, and should be safeguarded.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Perlu diambil perhatian bahawa apabila mencipta pemboleh ubah persekitaran, kunci API anda masih disimpan secara tempatan dalam teks biasa, dan perlu dilindungi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Authenticate requests to the Qiskit Runtime REST API by including the CRN "
"and bearer token to the request's headers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sahkan permintaan ke Qiskit Runtime REST API dengan menyertakan CRN dan "
"token pembawa dalam pengepala permintaan.\n"

